# --- Corpus source documents (licensing) ---
# The Sphere Handbook is all-rights-reserved: local educational/research use is
# permitted, redistribution is not. Other corpus PDFs are looser but are kept out
# of git for consistency. Re-download them with ingestion/fetch-corpus.sh.
# Provenance and per-file licenses stay tracked in ingestion/corpus/SOURCES.md.
ingestion/corpus/*.pdf

